  "instruction": "The size 2 gearbox first-article run for the rev G housing is supposed to happen this week and Célia asked for Thursday. It is a long continuous run with CMM inspection, so I need to know whether Thursday genuinely fits on a CMM-capable line without displacing the audit preparation block, and if it does not, the earliest day that does. Confirm the rev G fixture sets are actually usable too, and do not let the withdrawn duplicate change confuse the picture. Book the pending reservation where it truly fits, and leave a note for Célia with the date, what constrained it, and what the alternatives would have cost or required.",
